        "original_id": "aad724a9-472c-525a-a101-1d46659a75d3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bob Pruett, Randy Moss, Chad Pennington, Byron Leftwich\n- Roles: American football player, coach, wide receiver\n- Organizations: National Football League (NFL)\n- Topics: NFL career records, coaching relationships\n\nFacts:\n- Bob Pruett was born on June 20, 1943, and he is a former American football player and coach.\n- Randy Moss was born on February 13, 1977, and he is a former American football wide receiver.\n- Randy Moss played 14 seasons in the National Football League.\n- Randy Moss set the NFL rookie single-season touchdown reception record with 17 in 1998.\n- Bob Pruett coached high-profile NFL players including Randy Moss, Chad Pennington, and Byron Leftwich.\n- Randy Moss set the NFL single-season touchdown reception record with 23 in 2007.\n- Randy Moss is second on the NFL all-time regular-season touchdown reception list with 156.",
